{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>To give him a double portion</b> Because he takes a double portion: In the letters of בכור there is a matter of doubling — the bet is doubled over the letter before it, and likewise the kaf over the yod before it, and likewise the resh. And the vav is written doubled, for they write it as two vavins." "<b>יכיר</b> Gematria לאחר — as we expound: He recognizes him to others." "<b>בכל</b> אשר ימצא לו כי. ס״ת ראוי ולמ״ד דבכול ואל״ף דאשר הוא לא. And that is: לא ראוי, that the firstborn does not take a double portion as ראוי." "<b>ראשית אונו</b> Every ראשית is choice. ראשית דגנך; קדש ישראל לה׳; ראשית תבואתה." "<b>לו משפט הבכרה</b>"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:12.687054768Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}